# Emboldening outlines without an orientation where the emboldening
# strength is zero: heights below one pixel per em that still size the face
# (x_ppem 1), with a clockwise square beside a single point, a figure eight
# with equal lobes and two squares whose areas cancel.
family Triergon Zero Strength
units-per-em 1000
metrics 800 -200
heights 40 63
modes outlines
glyph advance 500
end
glyph advance 600 char 0x41
  contour 100 0, 100 700, 500 700, 500 0
end
glyph advance 600 char 0x46
  contour 300 300
end
glyph advance 600 char 0x48
  contour 100 0, 500 700, 500 0, 100 700
end
glyph advance 900 char 0x45
  contour 100 0, 100 400, 400 400, 400 0
  contour 500 0, 800 0, 800 400, 500 400
end
